  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:944ea4a836754fd16f9edcca25fed8c9141311496405b9f1537cc54559df1129",
      "text": "TV问答节目的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7818a9cba04b2527a953560d21e50f96bf586dd17c0fec39d63f86943932677",
      "text": "玄、玄武先生……\n方便的话，这几本书……哇哇！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0c1c052747276780f621d1ebaf411967bff3531018fac2e0814d40921f66cfb",
      "text": "危险！……呼，真是千钧一发。\n没摔倒就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d0aad94933b788da9df70fef221cab7ffc6dfc47fd963bc10311bb289e8b09c",
      "text": "不、不好意思，承蒙您出手相助……\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:434d94662b4ea90e78605706f135177526111c404da8e7a2abd0b38e74940af2",
      "text": "不用客气。\n不过，这一大堆书是怎么回事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:282d83d8a81cf1e0deb8367e85291a9d0d57df46a07cdf472168ec7ea4e2b30c",
      "text": "玄武先生下次要出演的问答节目，\n需要与精通各个领域的各路专家对决。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:796518a10c063c249fe82fbd72d496c4b2654089a53223c9345559d84950ed5f",
      "text": "我想着哪怕能帮上一点忙也好，\n就给您准备了这些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b2d97821ef6f0c9e816d691d0b461fbc53c3c57c6f798b36656170c8fb8c87a",
      "text": "那可帮大忙了。\n我正好在找能用作参考的书呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9062257b41c862c7a9a6e63305e35149e5e032bd7d1d1e85e8b085e767ac5b3e",
      "text": "生物、物理、历史，甚至连通俗小说都有……\n收集齐这么多很不容易吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d02a7d38ddccd37b9b1e1fbfb9c8158f218d20979eff88e4342bbf71a3e49b60",
      "text": "不会不会，这点事算不了什么。\n要是还需要别的什么，请随时告诉我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcdb79203ff9dacb6076d7822397fecf36c31b829a9e5e4d7e01a41647a10b48",
      "text": "哈哈，真是太可靠了。\n我一定会赢到最后的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
